# satpulsewb over a pty (writable, so the corrections write-back path exists and
# the runner can capture it), the access token enabled, auto-connecting to the
# receiver replay. The scenario starts corrections from the API against the fake
# source the runner declares in CORRECTION_SOURCE.
-L
127.0.0.1:${SATPULSE_TEST_HTTP_PORT}
-t
-d
${SATPULSE_TEST_SERIAL}
-s
38400
